~ Npc
Danilo: [center]Kailagan ko munang hanapin yung bus pa Santa Claridad bago ako bumili ng ticket.[/center]
=> END

~ unknown_message
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Unknown Number", "So, nagdecide ka pa lang bumalik?")
Unknown_sender: [wait=1.5] So, nagdecide ka pa lang bumalik?
- Answer => Answer
- Ignore => Ignore
=> END

~ Ignore
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_2_scene_3", "relief")
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Player", "Tumigil ka na!")
Danilo: Tumigil ka na!
=> END

~ Answer
do SaveManager.save_moral_choice("act_2_scene_3", "restless")
do ChatManager.send_chat("unknown_sender", "Player", "Oo. I need answers.")
Danilo: Oo. I need answers.
=> END